  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capacity of Rural Haitien Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fondation Hatienne pour le Maintien de la Paix Sociale/Partenariat pour le Dveloppement Local (FOHMAPS/PDL), through PDL, its rural development program, will train 3,000 members of grassroots groups to manage agricultural, community health, conservation and microcredit activities in Haiti&apos;s North and Artibonite departments. It will develop the leadership that enables the groups to form larger organizations and become self-sufficient.</narrative>
  </description>
